    "type": "game",
    "name": "Interstellar Holy Spirit",
    "steam_appid": 3726830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726830/extras/9604c5156a5a70be7c1aade820535db5.avif?t=1754741078\" width=1301 height=729 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several years have passed in a blink of an eye since the interstellar escape. I haven't been able to sleep lately, there's always a shadow swaying in front of me. Does it not look like a human? These shadows swayed back and forth, finally stopping on the wall, motionless, suddenly turning into puppets and zombies, rushing towards me! I woke up and saw psychedelic interstellar spaces unfolding in front of me .....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726830/extras/529f394de2bfce51c1fc784862c62784.avif?t=1754741078\" width=1301 height=729 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Interstellar Holy Spirit&quot; is <u>a multiplayer cooperative horror adventure game with a psychedelic style that can be played by 1-6 players</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726830/extras/8152a7fb764d1b926b432bc1fb54a66f.avif?t=1754741078\" width=1303 height=731 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to complete the tasks displayed on the screen of each level individually or collaboratively within a limited time. After completing the final task, a painting will appear to clear the level, and players can find and upgrade to the next level through the exit; During the mission, players will encounter attacks from puppet guardians and zombie guardians in the level. As time passes, zombies will increase their speed. Players can (but not necessarily) search for weapons from interstellar space paintings and kill them. After the first five consecutive kills, they will accumulate energy and use the ultimate Interstellar Punishment to eliminate threats within their range in one go during the sixth kill; If all players are killed by the Guardians or the time limit is reached, the game will exit and players will challenge the Interstellar Holy Spirit again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726830/extras/a3f4fe59855383e57ecd2702ef4f408c.avif?t=1754741078\" width=1301 height=732 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game button: E-obtain weapons, collect missions, and put them into the recycling pottery jar; F-switch flashlight; Left mouse button - Kill puppets or zombies, and after accumulating five energy stars for the first time, the sixth kill will release a powerful Interstellar Punishment; Right mouse button - zoom in or out of view; AWSD - Move forward, backward, left, and right; Mouse movement - controls character rotation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726830/extras/36132e0e7a2ac0c17c2d28aff4145eb1.avif?t=1754741078\" width=1302 height=728 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726830/extras/9604c5156a5a70be7c1aade820535db5.avif?t=1754741078\" width=1301 height=729 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several years have passed in a blink of an eye since the interstellar escape. I haven't been able to sleep lately, there's always a shadow swaying in front of me. Does it not look like a human? These shadows swayed back and forth, finally stopping on the wall, motionless, suddenly turning into puppets and zombies, rushing towards me! I woke up and saw psychedelic interstellar spaces unfolding in front of me .....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726830/extras/529f394de2bfce51c1fc784862c62784.avif?t=1754741078\" width=1301 height=729 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Interstellar Holy Spirit&quot; is <u>a multiplayer cooperative horror adventure game with a psychedelic style that can be played by 1-6 players</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726830/extras/8152a7fb764d1b926b432bc1fb54a66f.avif?t=1754741078\" width=1303 height=731 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to complete the tasks displayed on the screen of each level individually or collaboratively within a limited time. After completing the final task, a painting will appear to clear the level, and players can find and upgrade to the next level through the exit; During the mission, players will encounter attacks from puppet guardians and zombie guardians in the level. As time passes, zombies will increase their speed. Players can (but not necessarily) search for weapons from interstellar space paintings and kill them. After the first five consecutive kills, they will accumulate energy and use the ultimate Interstellar Punishment to eliminate threats within their range in one go during the sixth kill; If all players are killed by the Guardians or the time limit is reached, the game will exit and players will challenge the Interstellar Holy Spirit again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726830/extras/a3f4fe59855383e57ecd2702ef4f408c.avif?t=1754741078\" width=1301 height=732 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game button: E-obtain weapons, collect missions, and put them into the recycling pottery jar; F-switch flashlight; Left mouse button - Kill puppets or zombies, and after accumulating five energy stars for the first time, the sixth kill will release a powerful Interstellar Punishment; Right mouse button - zoom in or out of view; AWSD - Move forward, backward, left, and right; Mouse movement - controls character rotation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726830/extras/36132e0e7a2ac0c17c2d28aff4145eb1.avif?t=1754741078\" width=1302 height=728 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A multiplayer cooperative horror adventure game with a psychedelic style that can be played by 1-6 players! Players need to complete the tasks displayed on the screen of each level individually or collaboratively within a limited time and pass the Interstellar gate.",
